    {
      "id": "claim_ec6c9374ff4d44cbb3bf2a5efe1764d9",
      "statement": "`Main` instantiates connectors reflectively at startup: for each entry in the msp/rsp/csp/void/bill_rsp/merchant/psp connector arrays it loads the `class` field and invokes the `(String id, JsonObject properties)` constructor, appending to static lists on `Main`; this is the primary extension point since new schemes only need a class and a config.json entry.",
