      "statement": "The checked-in config.json declares broad connector families: PSP connectors (empty in current config), MSP connectors (ONUS/OnePAY, BIDV, VCB, ESP, ESHOP), RSP refund connectors (DSP, BIDV, VIB, WSP, MOMO, GRABPAY, ZALOPAY, VIETINQR, MSBQR, UNIONPAY, SHOPEEPAY, VIETTELMONEY, VIETQR), plus void/csp/merchant/query-pay connectors, each carrying downstream URLs, timeouts, and OWS1-HMAC-SHA256 or partner credentials.",
