      "id": "claim_116ac4f5fecd41198bf5928223fd4f0a",
      "statement": "config.json carries business-rules data beyond connectivity: `vpc_errors` maps named reasons (HOMECREDIT/KREDIVO/KBANK/AMIGO/ONECREDIT/ONECOMM) to VPC response codes and messages, `vpc_cards`/`accept_instruments` drive accepted-instrument matching, `instrument_mask` applies card-number masking, and per-merchant overrides (`merchant_extend_expired_time`, `time_cut_off_refund_bnpl_by_merchant`) are read through Config accessors.",
